  "description": "Ji-Hoo and Eugene reunite as PD and writer at a webtoon contest awards ceremony. The two, who were college classmates, did assignments together and even kissed… but Ji-Hoo avoids Eugene’s calls and treats him only as a writer even after becoming his PD. One day, when sharing the storyboard is delayed, Eugene complains about the pain of creation(?) due to his inexperience in dating and proposes a contract relationship to Ji-Hoo…\n\n*“I won’t let you go this time.”*\n\nWill Ji-Hoo and Eugene be able to finish their work safely?\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
